# Skill: Web Design Guidelines

Purpose:
  Web design guidelines skill. Covers UI/UX best practices, accessibility,
  visual design rules, and responsive design patterns for modern web apps.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1  @INDEX.sdd
   2  @SKILL.md

Modes:
  APPLY    — apply design guidelines to current task
  REVIEW   — review UI/UX against guidelines
  AUDIT    — audit design compliance

Rules:
  [WDG1] Guidelines MUST align with WCAG 2.1 AA minimum.
  [WDG2] Design rules MUST be actionable, not opinion-only.
  [WDG3] Color and typography MUST have contrast validation.

Entry:
  Read:
    INDEX.sdd
    SKILL.md

